@startuml togaf-business
title TOGAF 业务架构（Phase B）- WhatsFeed
skinparam shadowing false

archimate #Business "终端用户" as EndUser <<business-actor>>
archimate #Business "内容创作者" as Creator <<business-role>>
archimate #Business "平台管理员" as Admin <<business-actor>>

package "业务能力地图" {
  archimate #Business "身份与账号" as CapAuth <<business-capability>>
  archimate #Business "即时通讯" as CapMsg <<business-capability>>
  archimate #Business "音视频通话" as CapCall <<business-capability>>
  archimate #Business "信息流与帖子" as CapFeed <<business-capability>>
  archimate #Business "探索与推荐" as CapExplore <<business-capability>>
  archimate #Business "社交关系" as CapSocial <<business-capability>>
  archimate #Business "内容审核" as CapMod <<business-capability>>
  archimate #Business "平台运营" as CapOps <<business-capability>>
}

package "价值流 / 关键流程" {
  archimate #Business "注册与登录" as PAuth <<business-process>>
  archimate #Business "发布内容" as PPost <<business-process>>
  archimate #Business "消费信息流" as PFeed <<business-process>>
  archimate #Business "私信与通话" as PChat <<business-process>>
  archimate #Business "发现与关注" as PDiscover <<business-process>>
  archimate #Business "审核与处置" as PMod <<business-process>>
}

EndUser --> Creator : Assignment
EndUser --> CapAuth : Serving
EndUser --> CapMsg : Serving
EndUser --> CapFeed : Serving
EndUser --> CapExplore : Serving
EndUser --> CapSocial : Serving
EndUser --> CapCall : Serving
Admin --> CapOps : Serving
Admin --> CapMod : Serving

PAuth ..> CapAuth : Realization
PPost ..> CapFeed : Realization
PFeed ..> CapFeed : Realization
PChat ..> CapMsg : Realization
PChat ..> CapCall : Realization
PDiscover ..> CapExplore : Realization
PDiscover ..> CapSocial : Realization
PMod ..> CapMod : Realization

Creator --> PPost : Triggering
EndUser --> PFeed : Triggering
EndUser --> PChat : Triggering
Admin --> PMod : Triggering

note bottom of CapFeed
  业务层不出现技术栈名称。
  应用实现见 application-architecture.puml
end note

@enduml
